ment to data privacy and intuitive insights.</p>\n            <time class=\"absolute  bottom-sm  text-xs  md:text-sm  font-800\" datetime=\"2025-04-17\">17 Apr 2025</time>\n        </div>\n    </article>\n</li>                </ul>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n</section><p>The post <a href=\"https://teamupdraft.com/blog/updraftplus-supports-idrive-storage/\">IDrive now supported in UpdraftPlus as S3 storage</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://teamupdraft.com\">TeamUpdraft</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:1;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:63:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:26:\"WP-Optimize release v4.2.0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:56:\"https://teamupdraft.com/blog/wp-optimize-release-v4-2-0/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Mon, 12 May 2025 13:38:22 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:3:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"Uncategorized\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"Releases\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:11:\"WP-Optimize\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:34:\"https://teamupdraft.com/?p=7102849\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:312:\"<p>WP-Optimize 4.2.0 lets Premium users replace YouTube iframes with thumbnails - improving speed, Core Web Vitals, and SEO.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://teamupdraft.com/blog/wp-optimize-release-v4-2-0/\">WP-Optimize release v4.2.0</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://teamupdraft.com\">TeamUpdraft</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"Jelena Janić\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:32472:\"<section data-layout=\"article\" class=\"bg-white\">\n    <div class=\"container  py-rg\">\n        <div class=\"grid  gap-sm  grid-cols-1  sm:grid-cols-2  md:grid-cols-3  lg:grid-cols-4  xl:grid-cols-5  relative\">\n            \n            <!-- 1st column -->\n            <div class=\"hidden  xl:block  xl:col-end-s1\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Main collumn -->\n            <div class=\"col-end-s1  sm:col-end-s2  lg:col-end-s3\">\n\n                <div class=\"toc-start\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"wysiwyg\">\n\n                    \n<p>The latest update to WP-Optimize (version 4.2.0, released May 1, 2025) brings a powerful new feature for Premium users: the ability to replace YouTube iframes with static preview images. This enhancement can significantly boost your website&#8217;s loading speed, especially if your pages include multiple embedded videos.</p>\n<h2>Why This Feature Matters</h2>\n<p>Embedded YouTube videos are great for engagement, but they come at a cost: each iframe loads several external scripts and assets, which can drastically slow down your page. By swapping these iframes for lightweight preview images, your site avoids loading those heavy resources until a visitor clicks to play the video.</p>\n<h3>This means:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Faster initial page loads</li>\n<li>Better Core Web Vitals scores</li>\n<li>Improved user experience and SEO</li>\n<li>It’s a smart way to optimize video-heavy content without sacrificing visual appeal or functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Premium-Only Feature</h2>\n<p>This new YouTube iframe replacement option is available only in WP-Optimize Premium. If you&#8217;re not already using the Premium version, now’s a great time to upgrade. Learn more and get <a href=\"https://teamupdraft.com/wp-optimize/pricing/\">WP-Optimize Premium</a>.</p>\n<h3>How to Enable the Feature</h3>\n<p>Activating the YouTube thumbnail replacement is simple:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>In your WordPress dashboard, go to <strong>WP-Optimize &gt; Images</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Lazy-load tab</strong>.</li>\n<li>Check the box that says <strong>“Replace YouTube iframe with thumbnail image.”</strong></li>\n<li>Click <strong>Save</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<!-- image -->\r\n<figure data-layout=\"image\" class=\"overflow-hidden  rounded-md\" data-alt=\"Wp-Optimize replace Youtube iFrame preview feature\">\r\n    <img decoding=\"async\"\r\n                class=\"bg-main-1/3  border  border-main-1/10\"\r\n                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n        alt=\"Wp-Optimize replace Youtube iFrame preview feature\"\r\n        width=\"2048\"\r\n        height=\"1280\"\r\n        src=\"https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image-640x400.png\"\r\n        srcset=\"https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image-640x400.png 640w, https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image-1024x640.png 1024w, https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image-1440x900.png 1440w, https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image-300x188.png 300w, https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image-1280x800.png 1280w, https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image-768x480.png 768w, https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image-1680x1050.png 1680w, https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image-1920x1200.png 1920w, https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image-600x375.png 600w, https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/wp-optimize-replace-yt-iframe-preview-image.png 2048w\"\r\n        sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\"\r\n    >\r\n    </figure>\r\n<!-- image -->\n\n<p>That’s it! From now on, any embedded YouTube videos on your site will load as static images until clicked, drastically cutting down on unnecessary resource usage.</p>\n<h2>Other Improvements in 4.2.0</h2>\n<p>While this new Premium feature steals the spotlight, version 4.2.0 also includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A security fix for multisite installations</li>\n<li>Bug fixes for compatibility with WPML, Smush, and WebP image handling</li>\n<li>PHP 8.4 compatibility improved by addressing some key deprecation warnings</li>\n<li>Updated interface tweaks and banner ads</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>You can read the full changelog here:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Security</strong>: On multisite installs (only), a logged-in site administrator could use an unsanitised parameter to inject unwanted content into SQL queries. Thanks to Marc Montpas for the responsible disclosure.</li>\n<li><strong>Feature</strong>: Premium &#8211; Replace YouTube Iframes with preview images to improve page speed.</li>\n<li><strong>Fix</strong>: Fix conflict with the WPML plugin.</li>\n<li><strong>Fix</strong>: Smush &#8211; Fixed PHP warning on the Media Library page.</li>\n<li><strong>Fix</strong>: Smush &#8211; Fixed issue where the Smush popup would freeze.</li>\n<li><strong>Fix</strong>: WebP images not served after WP-Optimize reactivation.</li>\n<li><strong>Refactor</strong>: Smush option removed from media upload modal.</li>\n<li><strong>Tweak</strong>: Update advert banner logos, texts and links.</li>\n<li><strong>Tweak</strong>: Add missing separator between compression items in media library.</li>\n<li><strong>Tweak</strong>: Avoid PHP warning thrown by Page Speed Ninja plugin.</li>\n<li><strong>Tweak</strong>: Cache &#8211; Start caching after plugins loaded.</li>\n<li><strong>Tweak</strong>: Fix PHP deprecation warning in PHPSQLParser for PHP 8.4.</li>\n<li><strong>Tweak</strong>: Fix deprecation warning in Updraft_Logger class for PHP 8.4.</li>\n<li><strong>Tweak</strong>: Fixes absence of checkbox to remove all transients.</li>\n<li><strong>Tweak</strong>: Premium &#8211; Support and feedback links in Help tab now point to getwpo.com.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Author -->\n                <div class=\"mt-rg\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mb-xs\">About the author</h3>\n                    <div class=\"col-end-s5  flex\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"block  bg-white  border-3  border-orange  mr-xs  overflow-hidden  rounded-full  relative  size-[70px]\">\n                                <figure class=\"block  absolute  inset-[3px]  rounded-full  overflow-hidden\">\n                                                                        <img decoding=\"async\"\n                                        class=\"absolute  inset-0  m-auto  object-cover  h-full  w-full\"\n                                        loading=\"lazy\" \n                                        alt=\"Profile picture of Jelena, the product manager for WP-Optimize\"\n                                        width=\"150\"\n                                        height=\"150\"\n                                        src=\"https://teamupdraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/jelena-janic-min-300x300.jpg\"\n                                    >\n                                                                    </figure>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <h4 class=\"block  text-rg  my-4xs  font-800\">Jelena Janić</h4>\n                            <p class=\"font-400  text-sm  my-0\">Jelena is the Product Manager for UpdraftPlus and WP-Optimize. With seven years of experience, she&#8217;s taken on many roles &#8211; from tester to developer and now product manager. Along the way, she noticed a disconnect between how products are built and what customers need, sparking a passion for steering products toward solutions that truly serve the people who use them. Today, she ensures every WP-Optimize development decision is geared toward boosting WordPress website performance, enhancing usability, and increasing customer satisfaction.</p>\n                                    \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                 <!-- Share -->\n                 <div class=\"mt-rg\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mb-xs\">Share this</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"reset  flex  mt-3xs\">\n                        <li class=\"reset\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fteamupdraft.com%2Fblog%2Fwp-optimize-release-v4-2-0%2F&#038;title=WP-Optimize%20release%20v4.2.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\" class=\"flex  items-center  mr-xs  sm:mr-2xs\">\n                                <span class=\"sr-only\">Share on Facebook</span>\n                                <i class=\"c-icon-rg  te