ではない位のベストマッチです。<br><br>\r\n\r\nゴールデンバルブと同じ、ラグ板を使ったパーツトゥパーツの手配線。<br>\r\n信号ラインには電解コンデンサーを使用せずディスクリートで回路を組んであります。<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Dl_1QFZBWTM\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n<br>\r\n<big><big><b>裏技！？</b></big></big>\r\n<body>\r\n <hr>\r\n<body>\r\n実は単体で使用してもめちゃくちゃカッコ良いブースターになります。\r\nクリーンなアンプでは程よいクランチサウンドになり、\r\nまた、クランチさせたチューブアンプをプッシュするのにも最適です。'),(45009,5758,'_comment','field_6450bfdc8eea5'),(45010,5758,'price','39,800'),(45011,5758,'_price','field_63c249f43a52b'),(45012,5758,'listpice',''),(45013,5758,'_listpice','field_63c249f43a560'),(45014,5758,'year',''),(45015,5758,'_year','field_63c249f43a602'),(45016,5758,'condition','新品'),(45017,5758,'_condition','field_63c249f43a638'),(45018,5758,'stock','in'),(45019,5758,'_stock','field_63c249f43a6a3'),(45020,5758,'button','store'),(45021,5758,'_button','field_6450b13b42fe3'),(45022,5758,'store-url','https://funkojisan.shop/items/644bb181c5d1bb10c8d296f8'),(45023,5758,'_store-url','field_646737b1721ae'),(45024,5758,'video_field',''),(45025,5758,'_video_field','field_6464756246359'),(45026,5758,'video_field2',''),(45027,5758,'_video_field2','field_646af7377615e'),(45028,5758,'video_field3',''),(45029,5758,'_video_field3','field_646af7437615f'),(45030,5761,'title','DEER MAN Booster'),(45031,5761,'_title','field_63c249f43a297'),(45032,5761,'picture1','5759'),(45033,5761,'_picture1','field_63c249f43a2ce'),(45034,5761,'picture2',''),(45035,5761,'_picture2','field_63c249f43a304'),(45036,5761,'picture3',''),(45037,5761,'_picture3','field_63c249f43a33a'),(45038,5761,'picture4',''),(45039,5761,'_picture4','field_63c249f43a370'),(45040,5761,'picture5',''),(45041,5761,'_picture5','field_63c249f43a3a5'),(45042,5761,'picture6',''),(45043,5761,'_picture6','field_63c249f43a3dc'),(45044,5761,'picture7',''),(45045,57