四次元サウンドの音を作ります<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/四次元ファズ右部分.jpg\"><br>\r\nMode  上がハイゲイン　下がローゲイン<br>\r\nGate  上げていくと12時位から発振を始めます<br>\r\nMix  音量のコントロールです<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/四次元FREQ.jpg\"><br>\r\n<img src=\"https://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/四次元ファズSENS.jpg\"><br>\r\nSens  タッチセンサーの感度を調節します<br>\r\nFreq  ファズの音色や発振の周波数をコントロールします<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/四次元ファズスイッチ.jpg\"><br>\r\n\r\nOn/Off エフェクター全体のオンオフです<br>\r\n4dim  ミックスされる側のファズのオンオフです。<br>'),(52176,6206,'_comment','field_6450bfdc8eea5'),(52177,6206,'price','45,800'),(52178,6206,'_price','field_63c249f43a52b'),(52179,6206,'listpice',''),(52180,6206,'_listpice','field_63c249f43a560'),(52181,6206,'year',''),(52182,6206,'_year','field_63c249f43a602'),(52183,6206,'condition','新品'),(52184,6206,'_condition','field_63c249f43a638'),(52185,6206,'stock','in'),(52186,6206,'_stock','field_63c249f43a6a3'),(52187,6206,'button','store'),(52188,6206,'_button','field_6450b13b42fe3'),(52189,6206,'store-url','https://funkojisan.shop/items/65b20f14b4982d002bd6102d'),(52190,6206,'_store-url','field_646737b1721ae'),(52191,6206,'video_field','https://youtu.be/u5vrM0bi01I?si=kN_PkA5AGHQy8zmr'),(52192,6206,'_video_field','field_6464756246359'),(52193,6206,'video_field2',''),(52194,6206,'_video_field2','field_646af7377615e'),(52195,6206,'video_field3',''),(52196,6206,'_video_field3','field_646af7437615f'),(52197,6208,'title','四次元ファズ'),(52198,6208,'_title','field_63c249f43a297'),(52199,6208,'picture1',''),(52200,6208,'_picture1','field_63c249f43a2ce'),(52201,6208,'picture2',''),(52202,6208,'_picture2','field_63c249f43a304'),(52203,6208,'picture3',''),(52204,6208,'_picture3','field_63c249f43a33a'),(52205,6208,'picture4',''),(52206,6208,'_picture4','field_63c249f43a370'),(52207,6208,'picture5',''),(52208,6208,'_picture5','field_63c249f43a3a5'),(52209,6208,'picture6',''),(52210,6208,'_picture6','f