を始めます<br>\r\nMix  音量のコントロールです<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/四次元FREQ.jpg\"><br>\r\n<img src=\"https://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/四次元ファズSENS.jpg\"><br>\r\nSens  タッチセンサーの感度を調節します<br>\r\nFreq  ファズの音色や発振の周波数をコントロールします<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/四次元ファズスイッチ.jpg\"><br>\r\n\r\nOn/Off エフェクター全体のオンオフです<br>\r\n4dim  ミックスされる側のファズのオンオフです。<br>'),(53512,6311,'_comment','field_6450bfdc8eea5'),(53513,6311,'price','42,800'),(53514,6311,'_price','field_63c249f43a52b'),(53515,6311,'listpice',''),(53516,6311,'_listpice','field_63c249f43a560'),(53517,6311,'year',''),(53518,6311,'_year','field_63c249f43a602'),(53519,6311,'condition','新品'),(53520,6311,'_condition','field_63c249f43a638'),(53521,6311,'stock','out'),(53522,6311,'_stock','field_63c249f43a6a3'),(53523,6311,'button','contact'),(53524,6311,'_button','field_6450b13b42fe3'),(53525,6311,'store-url',''),(53526,6311,'_store-url','field_646737b1721ae'),(53527,6311,'video_field','https://youtu.be/u5vrM0bi01I?si=kN_PkA5AGHQy8zmr'),(53528,6311,'_video_field','field_6464756246359'),(53529,6311,'video_field2',''),(53530,6311,'_video_field2','field_646af7377615e'),(53531,6311,'video_field3',''),(53532,6311,'_video_field3','field_646af7437615f'),(53533,6312,'_wp_attached_file','2024/12/スクリーンショット-74.jpg'),(53534,6312,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:677;s:6:\"height\";i:813;s:4:\"file\";s:42:\"2024/12/スクリーンショット-74.jpg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:114026;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:42:\"スクリーンショット-74-250x300.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:250;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:15016;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:42:\"スクリーンショット-74-150x150.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:6083;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0