n<br>\r\n\r\n裏蓋を開けると、小さくてわかりづらいですがGAINと見える穴の部分にトリマーがありますのでゲイン量を調整できます。<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"https://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2634D2D1-C1A5-477D-9167-19732F587216-scaled.jpg\">'),(54664,6367,'_comment','field_6450bfdc8eea5'),(54665,6367,'price','42,800'),(54666,6367,'_price','field_63c249f43a52b'),(54667,6367,'listpice',''),(54668,6367,'_listpice','field_63c249f43a560'),(54669,6367,'year',''),(54670,6367,'_year','field_63c249f43a602'),(54671,6367,'condition','新品'),(54672,6367,'_condition','field_63c249f43a638'),(54673,6367,'stock','out'),(54674,6367,'_stock','field_63c249f43a6a3'),(54675,6367,'button','contact'),(54676,6367,'_button','field_6450b13b42fe3'),(54677,6367,'store-url',''),(54678,6367,'_store-url','field_646737b1721ae'),(54679,6367,'video_field',''),(54680,6367,'_video_field','field_6464756246359'),(54681,6367,'video_field2',''),(54682,6367,'_video_field2','field_646af7377615e'),(54683,6367,'video_field3',''),(54684,6367,'_video_field3','field_646af7437615f'),(54685,6368,'title','遺作と呼ばれるドライブペダル'),(54686,6368,'_title','field_63c249f43a297'),(54687,6368,'picture1','6360'),(54688,6368,'_picture1','field_63c249f43a2ce'),(54689,6368,'picture2','6347'),(54690,6368,'_picture2','field_63c249f43a304'),(54691,6368,'picture3','6357'),(54692,6368,'_picture3','field_63c249f43a33a'),(54693,6368,'picture4','6356'),(54694,6368,'_picture4','field_63c249f43a370'),(54695,6368,'picture5',''),(54696,6368,'_picture5','field_63c249f43a3a5'),(54697,6368,'picture6',''),(54698,6368,'_picture6','field_63c249f43a3dc'),(54699,6368,'picture7',''),(54700,6368,'_picture7','field_63c249f43a411'),(54701,6368,'picture8',''),(54702,6368,'_picture8','field_63c249f43a447'),(54703,6368,'picture9',''),(54704,6368,'_picture9','field_63c249f43a47d'),(54705,6368,'picture10',''),(54706,6368,'_picture10','field_63c249f43a4b3'),(54707,6368,'picture11',''),(54708,6368,'_picture11','field_63c249f43a4e9'),(54709,6368,'comment','<big><big><b>どんな歪みも出せちゃう？究極のオーバードライブペダル</b></big></big>\r\n