グネットはそれぞれ違うタイプのものを選別しており、２つのボビンの巻き数も変えてバランス良く仕上げています。<br>\r\n今までのミニハムバッカーにはないサウンドで、シングルコイルとハムバッカーの良いところを合わせたような絶妙なチューニングです。\r\n<br>\r\nP-90とサイズが同じなのでp-90の太さをもう少し軽くしたい方にもおすすめです。<br>\r\n<br>\r\n'),(57252,6507,'_comment','field_6450bfdc8eea5'),(57253,6507,'price','34,800'),(57254,6507,'_price','field_63c249f43a52b'),(57255,6507,'listpice',''),(57256,6507,'_listpice','field_63c249f43a560'),(57257,6507,'year',''),(57258,6507,'_year','field_63c249f43a602'),(57259,6507,'condition','新品'),(57260,6507,'_condition','field_63c249f43a638'),(57261,6507,'stock','in'),(57262,6507,'_stock','field_63c249f43a6a3'),(57263,6507,'button','store'),(57264,6507,'_button','field_6450b13b42fe3'),(57265,6507,'store-url',''),(57266,6507,'_store-url','field_646737b1721ae'),(57267,6507,'video_field',''),(57268,6507,'_video_field','field_6464756246359'),(57269,6507,'video_field2',''),(57270,6507,'_video_field2','field_646af7377615e'),(57271,6507,'video_field3',''),(57272,6507,'_video_field3','field_646af7437615f'),(57273,6508,'title','限りなくヴィンテージに近いP-90'),(57274,6508,'_title','field_63c249f43a297'),(57275,6508,'picture1','6499'),(57276,6508,'_picture1','field_63c249f43a2ce'),(57277,6508,'picture2',''),(57278,6508,'_picture2','field_63c249f43a304'),(57279,6508,'picture3',''),(57280,6508,'_picture3','field_63c249f43a33a'),(57281,6508,'picture4',''),(57282,6508,'_picture4','field_63c249f43a370'),(57283,6508,'picture5',''),(57284,6508,'_picture5','field_63c249f43a3a5'),(57285,6508,'picture6',''),(57286,6508,'_picture6','field_63c249f43a3dc'),(57287,6508,'picture7',''),(57288,6508,'_picture7','field_63c249f43a411'),(57289,6508,'picture8',''),(57290,6508,'_picture8','field_63c249f43a447'),(57291,6508,'picture9',''),(57292,6508,'_picture9','field_63c249f43a47d'),(57293,6508,'picture10',''),(57294,6508,'_picture10','field_63c249f43a4b3'),(57295,6508,'picture11',''),(57296,6508,'_picture11','field_63c249f43a4e9'),(57297,6508,'comment',''),(57298,6508,'_comment','field_6450bfdc8eea5'),(57299,6508,'price','36