ーなどは別のノーマルアウトプットが必要です。\r\n\r\n大きな電流は使えませんので、アウトプットのショートなどには特に気を付けてください。\r\n替えの効かない素子です。保証は効きません。\r\n\r\n<h3>価格</h3>\r\n基本料金  28000円\r\n\r\nスペシャルアウトプット2つ\r\n合計60mA程度まで\r\n\r\nノーマルアウトプット\r\n1A程度まで\r\nアウトプット2つ\r\n追加3000円\r\n\r\n各アウトプット1ケ追加毎に＋800円','Ancient Suplly','','inherit','closed','closed','','570-revision-v1','','','2020-01-18 21:12:21','2020-01-18 12:12:21','',570,'http://funkojisan.com/570-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(1123,1,'2020-01-23 14:46:57','2020-01-23 05:46:57','','S__9601041','','inherit','open','closed','','s__9601041','','','2020-01-23 14:46:57','2020-01-23 05:46:57','',0,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/S__9601041.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1124,1,'2020-01-23 14:47:02','2020-01-23 05:47:02','','S__9601042','','inherit','open','closed','','s__9601042','','','2020-01-23 14:47:02','2020-01-23 05:47:02','',0,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/S__9601042.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1125,1,'2020-01-23 14:47:17','2020-01-23 05:47:17','','S__9601043','','inherit','open','closed','','s__9601043','','','2020-01-23 14:47:17','2020-01-23 05:47:17','',0,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/S__9601043.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1126,1,'2020-01-23 14:47:22','2020-01-23 05:47:22','','S__9601044','','inherit','open','closed','','s__9601044','','','2020-01-23 14:47:22','2020-01-23 05:47:22','',0,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/S__9601044.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1127,1,'2020-01-23 14:47:28','2020-01-23 05:47:28','','S__9601045','','inherit','open','closed','','s__9601045','','','2020-01-23 14:47:28','2020-01-23 05:47:28','',0,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/S__9601045.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1128,1,'2020-01-23 14:47:33','2020-01-23 05:47:33','','S__9601046','','inherit','open','closed','','s__9601046','','','2020-01-23 14:47:33','2020-01-23 05:47:33','',0,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/S__9601046.jpg',0,'attachm