使用出来ます。<br>トゥルーバイパスでメインとなるエフェクターの音色を全く損ねる事がありません。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/brDK6bWDg9I\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/brDK6bWDg9I\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>価格</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>円（税込）</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">ご注文、お問い合わせは下のフォームよりお願いします。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Tricera Booster','','inherit','closed','closed','','3474-revision-v1','','','2022-08-21 17:54:01','2022-08-21 08:54:01','',3474,'http://funkojisan.com/?p=3478',0,'revision','',0),(3479,1,'2022-08-21 18:47:24','2022-08-21 09:47:24','','2','','inherit','open','closed','','2','','','2022-08-21 18:47:24','2022-08-21 09:47:24','',3474,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/2.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3480,1,'2022-08-21 18:47:51','2022-08-21 09:47:51','','3','','inherit','open','closed','','3','','','2022-08-21 18:47:51','2022-08-21 09:47:51','',3474,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/3.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3481,1,'2022-08-21 18:48:18','2022-08-21 09:48:18','','1','','inherit','open','closed','','1','','','2022-08-21 18:48:18','2022-08-21 09:48:18','',3474,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/1.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3482,1,'2022-08-21 18:51:11','2022-08-21 09:51:11','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>歪みと音量を一度に上げられるブースター</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3477,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://funkojisan.com/wp-con