ROSETTE Crosscut Grained Ivoroid &amp; Wood Strip</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">FINGERBOARD Ebony</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">FINGERBOARD INLAY Traditional Diamond &amp; Square</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">PEGHEAD OVERLAY Ebony</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">TUNER Waverly 4060N (Nickel)</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">TOP Selected Spruce</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">BRACING Pre-War Scalloped / Advanced X Pattern</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">PICKGUARD Tortoise Style</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">NECK Gloss-Finished Mahogany</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">NUT WIDTH 1 11/16\" (42.9mm)  SCALE 25 1/2\" (647.7mm)</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">BODY WIDTH 15\" (381.0mm)  BODY LENGTH 19 1/4\" (489.0mm)</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">BODY DEPTH 4 1/8\" (104.8mm)  TOTAL LENGTH 39 1/2\"(1003.3mm)</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">HEAD Solid Head</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">BRIDGE Ebony</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">FINISH High Gloss Lacquer</p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nハードケース付き','collings OM2H 95年製','','publish','closed','closed','','collings-om2h','','','2022-12-22 16:32:26','2022-12-22 07:32:26','',0,'http://funkojisan.com/?post_type=used&#038;p=4198',0,'used','',0),(4199,1,'2022-12-03 21:28:31','2022-12-03 12:28:31','','DSC02751','','inherit','open','closed','','dsc02751','','','2022-12-03 21:28:31','2022-12-03 12:28:31','',4198,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/DSC02751.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(4200,1,'2022-12-03 21:28:37','2022-12-03 12:28:37','','DSC02750','','inherit','open','closed','','dsc02750','','','2022-12-03 21:28:37','2022-12-03 12:28:37','',4198,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/DSC02750.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(4201,1,'2022-12-03 21:28:42','2022-12-03 12:28:42','','DSC02749','','inherit','open','closed','','dsc02749','','','2022-12-03 21:28:42','2022-12-03 12:28:42','',4198,'http://funkojisan.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/DSC02749.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(4202,1,'2022-12-03 21:28:48','2022-12-03 12:28:48','','DSC02748','','inherit','open','clos